  "title": "Baikonur Cosmodrome",
  "summary": "Baikonur Cosmodrome is a launch site on the flat grasslands of Kazakhstan, begun in 1955 as a secret Soviet missile site. Sputnik 1 was launched from it in 1957, and Yuri Gagarin, the first human in space, also launched from it. The associated city is rented and administered by the Russian Federation.",
